00:46:11.507 --> 00:46:15.543
No secret Ric was his favorite.


00:46:15.544 --> 00:46:19.647
And, um...


00:46:19.648 --> 00:46:23.384
At that age... your age,


00:46:23.385 --> 00:46:24.852
